<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#4078F2;--shiki-dark:#61AFEF;">modprobe</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;">  nf_conntrack_ipv4</span><span style="--shiki-light:#A0A1A7;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#7F848E;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic;">  ##高版本系统内核已经被“nf_conntrack”代替</span></span>
